    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d314-a1">

                <pb facs="0625" n="569" sameAs="frus:frus1876/pg569"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p>In obedience to the unanimous wish of the whole people, Abdul-Aziz Khan has been
                    dethroned to-day, and His Majesty Sultan Murad the Fifth, heir-presumptive of
                    the imperial throne, has been proclaimed Emperor of Turkey.</p>
                <closer><signed>THE GRAND VEZIER.</signed></closer>
            </div>
